---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Individual counselling" description="Individual counselling focused on relationship patterns, in Victoria, BC and across BC with Rachel Glover, RCC.">
<div class="wrap"><section class="pg-hero">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow rise" style="--d:.1s">Individual counselling</p>
        <h1 class="b-h1"><span class="mask"><span style="--d:.2s">Understand</span></span><span class="mask acc"><span style="--d:.36s">your patterns.</span></span></h1>
        <p class="lede rise" style="--d:.65s">The patterns we carry show up in every relationship. One-to-one counselling is space to understand yours, and to change the ones that aren’t working for you.</p>
        <div class="rise" style="--d:.8s;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free 15-minute call <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <svg class="pg-forms" viewBox="0 0 116 80" aria-hidden="true"><g class="r"><circle cx="58" cy="40" r="35.3" fill="none" stroke="#5C1A26" stroke-width="1.4"/></g>
        <g class="mid"><circle cx="58" cy="40" r="21" fill="#CDB792"/></g></svg>
    </section></div><section class="band"><div class="wrap split2">
      <div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What we might work on</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2">People see me on their own for…</h2></div>
      <div class="reveal"><ul class="checks stagger"><li>Relationship patterns that keep repeating, with partners, family or friends.</li><li>Thinking about a relationship: whether to stay, how to leave, or how to start again.</li><li>Setting boundaries without guilt.</li><li>Big transitions, like separation, a new family, or a move.</li><li>Wanting to show up differently for the people you love.</li></ul></div>
    </div></section><section class="band alt"><div class="wrap split2">
      <div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Sessions</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2">Sixty minutes, at your pace.</h2></div>
      <div class="reveal" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px"><p class="body">We’ll start by talking about what’s brought you in and what you’d like to be different. From there, sessions are practical: we look at what’s happening, why, and what you can try. If it would help, a partner can join later.</p>
      <ul class="fee-list"><li><span class="what">Individual session</span><span class="len">60 min</span><span class="amt">$140</span></li></ul></div>
    </div></section><section class="band dark"><div class="wrap b1-close reveal">
      <h2 class="b-h1">Start with a conversation. <span>The first 15 minutes are free.</span></h2>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn light-fill" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free consultation <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contact#qform">Ask a question</a></div>
    </div></section>
</Base>
